## Permitted Purpose

A permitted purpose is any purpose other than a competing
commercial purpose. A competing commercial purpose is any
purpose in which you or anyone else uses the software or any
change or new work based on it to provide a product or
service to third parties for a fee, or to otherwise generate
revenue directly or indirectly from distributing or hosting
the software.

